emUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">☁　　☁　　☁　　☁　　☁　　☁</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">▶︎ <ruby>日向<rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby>ちゃんねる</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"></p><div style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/hirao.honoka/2023-11-13/53398_8.jpg\" style=\"width:852px;max-width:100%\"></div><br><p></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"># <ruby>裏<rt>うら</rt></ruby>ヒットキャンペーン</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"># ひら<ruby>砲<rt>ほう</rt></ruby>の<ruby>使命<rt>しめい</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"># <ruby>大<rt>だい</rt></ruby>ヒットしますよーうに！</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><ruby>日向<rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby>ちゃんねるにて『マジック46<ruby>連発<rt>れんぱつ</rt></ruby>』に<ruby>挑戦<rt>ちょうせん</rt></ruby>しました！<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>てくださいましたか〜？</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)!important;border-color:rgb(0,0,0)!important;color:rgb(0,0,0)!important\" dir=\"auto\"><font style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>初<rt>はつ</rt></ruby>のヒットキャンペーン、<ruby>大変<rt>たいへん</rt></ruby>でしたが<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しかったです！<ruby>少<rt>すこ</rt></ruby>し<ruby>役目<rt>やくめ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>果<rt>は</rt></ruby>たせたような。</font></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0)\" dir=\"auto\"><font style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0)\" dir=\"auto\"><font style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0)\" dir=\"auto\"><font style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">みてほしいなーっ</font></p><p style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)!important;border-color:rgb(0,0,0)!important;color:rgb(0,0,0)!important\" dir=\"auto\"><font style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ぜひぜひごらんください</font></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0)\" dir=\"auto\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\" dir=\"auto\"><br><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><a href=\"http://youtu.be/xtqi-YrXfLI\" target=\"_blank\">youtu.be/xtqi-YrXfLI</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\" dir=\"auto\"><br><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">▶︎<ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby>のひらほー</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\" dir=\"auto\"></p><div style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/hirao.honoka/2023-11-13/53398_9.jpg\" style=\"width:750px;max-width:100%\"></div><br><p></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><ruby>先日<rt>せんじつ</rt></ruby>、<ruby>新参<rt>しんざん</rt></ruby><ruby>者<rt>しゃ</rt></ruby><ruby>櫻<rt>さくら</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby>さん<ruby>公演<rt>こうえん</rt></ruby>を<ruby>観<rt>かん</rt></ruby>に<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>かせて<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>きました🌸<ruby>時々<rt>ときどき</rt></ruby><ruby>連絡<rt>れんらく</rt></ruby>をとるおふたり☺︎︎︎︎☺︎︎︎︎</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">かっこよくて<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>くてついついペンライトを<ruby>振<rt>ふ</rt></ruby>るの<ruby>忘<rt>わす</rt></ruby>れちゃうような<ruby>公演<rt>こうえん</rt></ruby>でした。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>たちも<ruby>残<rt>のこ</rt></ruby>り6<ruby>公演<rt>こうえん</rt></ruby><ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>らなきゃ！</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><ruby>最後<rt>さいご</rt></ruby>まで<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んでくださってありがとうございました！また<ruby>次回<rt>じかい</rt></ruby>のブログでお<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いしましょう。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\\ﾋﾗﾎｰ!/</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;.AppleSystemUIFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextSty